  "comment": "Core 2 run creation constants that the web (model/state.js createRunState, advancedConfig.js, ashenBlight.js, combatEngagement.js, gameProfileGear.js and engine/kernel/gameConfig.js at the pinned sha b8cfe4fac) keeps as literals in code (docs/design/11 WP-3). template: the fields a new run starts with that no content decides; createRunState writes the rest. advancedConfig: advancedConfigSnapshot's version stamps (breakMeterVersion comes from rules/versions.json). fixedMode: the creation scale a fixed-attribute class is judged on. rangeSettingKeys: the profile settings that override rules/rangePolicy.json. gear: the resolveGearItem vocabulary. ashenBlight: the family to attribute map ashenBlightBonuses reads. derived: the stat-row formula's snapshot envelope version, the epsilon its floors take, and the row fields that are not attribute weights (derivedStats.js). statOptions: gameProfileStatOptions' pool aliases (stats.json spells mana and stamina mp and sp) and the hand rows the profile's handBase prices. combat: the framework mechanic mechanics.stamina.combatStartRefill ('full' at the pinned sha; the framework mechanics file is not exported for Core 2 yet, WP-4).",
